DJI RC-N1 Simulator Adapter

This project is based on DJI_RC-N1_SIMULATOR_FLY_DCL by IvanYaky:
https://github.com/IvanYaky/DJI_RC-N1_SIMULATOR_FLY_DCL

Modifications include Windows setup automation, virtual environment bootstrapping,
desktop shortcut support, lower-latency gamepad updates, and simulator-focused packaging.

